{"step_index":1535,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-13T07:17:08Z","input_tokens":5227,"cache_read_tokens":60906,"output_tokens":1618,"thinking":"Analyzing the provided scores and their associated image page numbers to identify a pattern. Initial hypothesis: the page numbers might correspond to chapters or significant events within a specific narrative. The text fragments suggest they are likely from a manga or light novel.\n\n\nThe image page numbers precisely correlate to chapter headings and key narrative moments within \"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo!\". Confirmed the series title, author (Akatsuki Natsume), illustrator (Kurone Mishima), and language (Indonesian). The output EPUBs will be placed in a directory for volume 17.1, with a separate folder for cached illustrations. Examining how chapters are organized across the volumes using header patterns.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import os, re\n\nbase_dir = r\"D:\\JV\\[Ruidrive] Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Bakuen wo!\\[Ruidrive] Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Bakuen wo!\\[Ruidrive] Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Bakuen wo! - Volume 17.1\"\ntxt_path = os.path.join(base_dir, \"Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! - Volume 01-17 + Bakuen 17.1 (Terjemahan ID-Direct).txt\")\n\nwith open(txt_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    text = f.read()\n\nvol_keys = ['01', '02', '03', '04', '05', '06', '07', '08', '09', '10', '11', '12', '13', '14', '15', '16', '17', '17.1']\n\n# Slice volumes\nvol_starts = {}\nfor vk in vol_keys:\n    m = re.search(rf\"^###\\s+VOLUME\\s+{re.escape(vk)}\\b\", text, re.MULTILINE | re.IGNORECASE)\n    if m:\n        vol_starts[vk] = m.start()\n\nfor i, vk in enumerate(vol_keys):\n    start = vol_starts[vk]\n    end = vol_starts[vol_keys[i+1]] if i+1 < len(vol_keys) else len(text)\n    vol_text = text[start:end]\n    \n    # Split by ###\n    raw_sections = re.split(r\"(?=^###\\s+)\", vol_text, flags=re.MULTILINE)\n    chapters = []\n    for sec in raw_sections:\n        sec = sec.strip()\n        if not sec.startswith(\"###\"):\n            continue\n        lines = sec.split(\"\\n\")\n        title_line = re.sub(rf\"^###\\s+(?:VOLUME\\s+{re.escape(vk)}\\s*[-:]*\\s*)?\", \"\", lines[0], flags=re.IGNORECASE).strip()\n        body = \"\\n\".join(lines[1:]).strip()\n        if len(body) > 50:\n            chapters.append({\"title\": title_line, \"chars\": len(body)})\n            \n    print(f\"Vol {vk}: {len(chapters)} chapters -> {[c['title'][:25] for c in chapters]}\")\n","Path":"C:\\Users\\Eevyx\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\dfaefe40-f699-4276-8717-cb4f8030016c\\scratch\\test_all_chapters.py"}}]}
